h ah\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n\n<br>\n<!-- #2-1 -->\n\n\n\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">行<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">걀</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">來到<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">래ᄀᅷ`</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">쟈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">去<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">킈`</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">到<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">ᄀᅷ`</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">햐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">世間<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">세`간ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">遐邇<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">햫ˆ니</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">大<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">돠ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    kiaa-lai-kàu-jiâ, khì-kàu-hiâ, sè-kân hiâh-ni-toā\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">流行<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">류혱</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">啥物<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">衫<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">살ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">啥物<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">車<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">챠ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">란<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">綴<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">뒈`</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">렣<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">奅<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">팔ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    liu-hieng-siâa-mîh sâa, siâa-mîh chiâ, làn lông-tuè-lêh-phāa\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">念<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">럄</rt></ruby>둏<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">啥物<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">聲<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">샬ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">啥物<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">歌<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">과ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攏總<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">렁ˆ정`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">렣<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">講<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">햐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    liam-tioh-siâa-mîh siâa, siâa-mîh koâ, lông-jòng lêh-kông-hiâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">講<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">겅`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">란<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">綴<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">뒈`</rt></ruby>렣<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">行<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">걀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    lì kòng làn lông-tuè-leh-kiáa\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">保庇<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">보ˆ비</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">保庇<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">보ˆ비</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">保庇<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">보ˆ비</rt></ruby> 앟\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    pô-pi pô-pi pô-pi ah\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    음<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">通<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">탕ˉ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">곻<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心頭<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉᄐᅷˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一直<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">읻ˆ딛</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">掠<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">럏</rt></ruby>뾔<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">定<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">뎽ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    m-thāng-kôh-sīm-tháu ît-tit-liah-boe-tiēng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    (<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">指點<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">지ˆ댬`</rt></ruby>’랗 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">指點<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">지ˆ댬`</rt></ruby>’랗 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">指點<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">지ˆ댬`</rt></ruby>’랗 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">求<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">규</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">神通<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">신텅ˆ</rt></ruby>)\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    (jî-tiàm’lah jî-tiàm’lah jî-tiàm’lah kiu-sin-thông)\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"jiâh\">遮<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">認真<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">띤진ˉ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">拍拚<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">팧ˆ뱔</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">為<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">위</rt></ruby>둏<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">啥<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">샬`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jiâh-rin-jīn-phâh-piaa lông-si-wi-tioh-siàa\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    (<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">試看覓<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">치`콸`매ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">試看覓<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">치`콸`매ˉ</rt></ruby>’릐)\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    (chì-khoàa-māi chì-khoàa-māi’li)\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">求<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">규</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">籤詩<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">챰ˉ시ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">抽<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">튜ˉ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">籤詩<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">챰ˉ시ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: bloc